      "uid": "zhcn:57eb3c402825611a90682738",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是、我已经……，\n不能像从前那样奔跑了――",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ed69e78ae924c8cb0127cbc08f1424f1d4e3a3d9f6b8861bedcc0a1561322bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
