    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bf7cee2eb31165debc03ab4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "整个街道都散发着柔和的光芒。\n圣诞节的灯饰、大楼的霓虹灯。\n家家户户窗户里透出的光。还有――",
      "source_fingerprint": "38a071fde89b4a88992c5aac9d42f7f52a9325ceb231b518aa2fb943c3044ae0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143208.json",
      "json_path": [
