    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da305832198a65b62e275b04",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "装点年末的大奖赛『有马纪念』！\n关注的焦点果然还是肩负了时代的\n经典三冠赛马娘黄金巨匠吧――",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f82370d1ce4373ec2422acf9cfc098baff07f54d076004f861cec6976a96d86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
